[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     7[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     8[0m:[38;5;10m[49m Facts about the C source that shape this table:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     9[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
