[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    11[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   (`RETURN_ERROR` etc.), **no** `errno` use, and **no** explicit range / null /
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    12[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   min-max constant checks. The only sentinel is `NULL`.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    13[0m:[38;5;10m[49m * The only inputs are three `const char *`. There are **no enum parameters**, so
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    14[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   "out-of-range enum value across FFI" is not an applicable input class for this
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+    15[0m:[38;5;10m[49m   API (recorded as row 12 for completeness).
